o finish a task. You MUST call this tool when your work is done.\nImportant: - Always provide comprehensive results in the 'result' argument - Ensure your findings follow any formatting requested in the instructions - Do not call any other tools after calling complete_task - Failure to call this tool will result in a protocol violation\nIf your investigation was interrupted (e.g., by timeout or turn limit), explain what you were able to accomplish and what remains incomplete.", 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'result': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Your final results or findings to return. Ensure this is comprehensive and follows any formatting requested in your instructions.'}}, 'required': ['result'], 'additionalProperties': False, '$schema': 'http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#'}}}], 'user': 'local_54c394ad'}}
